msgid "ComplianceStandardsAdherence|Set up IaC scanning"
msgstr "Compriancestandardsadherence | IAC ச்கேனிங் அமைக்கவும்"

msgid ""
"ComplianceStandardsAdherence|Set up SAST in your CI/CD pipeline to "
