msgid ""
"ComplianceStandardsAdherence|Your standards adherence CSV export for the "
"group %{group_link} is attached to this email."
msgstr ""
"compriancestandardardherence | உங்கள் தரநிலைகள் %{group_link for குழுவிற்கான"
