"%{code_start}api%{code_end} scope. For source instances on GitLab 15.0 or "
"earlier, the token must additionally have the "
"%{code_start}read_repository%{code_end} scope. For "
"%{short_living_link_start}security reasons%{short_living_link_end}, set a "
"short expiration date for the token. Keep in mind that large migrations take"
